  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Primary path — costs 0 quota calls",
      "items": [
        "Toss loads the Vite bundle over HTTPS; there is no server-rendered tier.",
        "HomeScreen calls useAreaCongestion(); TanStack Query answers it for 5 minutes.",
        "/api/hotspots takes no parameters, so all users share one CDN cache key.",
        "SeoulRtd returns all 121 areas in one unauthenticated call."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust boundaries",
      "items": [
        "openapi.seoul.go.kr is plaintext HTTP :8088 only, so an HTTPS page cannot call it.",
        "The proxy is not an optimisation — it is the only route that exists.",
        "SEOUL_API_KEY stays in Vercel env; redactApiKey() scrubs it from thrown errors.",
        "Area names are checked against the areas.ts catalog before any upstream call."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Quota budget and failure posture",
      "items": [
        "Detail costs 24 congestion + 8 cityinfo calls/day per area a user opens.",
        "~30 distinct detail opens/day reaches ~960 of 1,000 — unguarded today.",
        "hotspots fails as 502; cctv and ppltn fail as empty — that upstream is undocumented.",
        "Failures set no-store; Age is CORS-exposed so the UI can admit staleness."
      ]
    }
  ]
